    "updated_at": "2026-11-11T22:18:28Z",
    "body": "I agree it's silly, but all browsers have this difference of height vs min/max-height on replaced elements, so I did the same in Servo. But adding another difference of replaced vs non-replaced seemed even sillier, and the spec doesn't mention anything of that sort, so I aligned with Firefox.",
